# ── #33 round 11: RENAME IS A LIFECYCLE OPERATION ────────────────────
# It never took a lifecycle lock — a gap that pre-dates #33 (it raced end and launch
# too) and that #33 made concrete: pause a freezer before it locks `oldslot`, end
# oldslot, rename a live identity-less session INTO that name, release, and the
